  "body": "## 更新重点\n\n- 新增 Cursor CLI，支持聊天、群聊、工作流和独立的 Studio MCP 配置。\n- 新增可配置的 JEV 记忆、技能、浏览器、群聊与工作流检查。\n- 增强浏览器批量操作、多标签页和大页面处理，改进桌面更新下载进度。\n- 修复 DSH 新版预置与插件配置兼容性、配置持久化和插件页面布局，同时保留旧版适配。\n- 修复聊天附件、长对话搜索、会话置顶、Hermes 更新与跨实例 MCP 路由等问题。\n\n## What's Changed\n* [codex] keep Hermes task-plan MCP on its owning Studio instance by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3157\n* [codex] fix DSH update dependency conflicts and startup errors by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3156\n* [codex] add JEV settings tab and shared evaluation client by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3159\n* [codex] add Ekko JEV module and configuration guardrails by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3160\n* [codex] add JEV memory recall, relevance filtering and write review by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3161\n* fix(push): retire stale Live Activity destinations by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3167\n* [codex] fix attachments in new App and Studio chats by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3168\n* feat: enhance Ekko skill matching and learning with unified JEV settings by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3169\n* fix(codex): deduplicate scoped TOML table keys by @avatar0813 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3163\n* docs: plan JEV enhancements for group chat and workflows by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3171\n* [codex] hide context limits for coding-agent chats by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3174\n* [codex] show desktop update progress and add isolated test builds by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3176\n* [codex] publish desktop update test builds for macOS, Windows and Linux by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3177\n* [codex] clarify JEV isolation and concurrency requirements by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3183\n* [codex] fix long-chat search navigation and loading by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3182\n* [codex] set responsive group bubble widths and card spacing by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3188\n* [codex] resolve DSH ACP from its owning bundle by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3190\n* [codex] fix group Coding Agent MCP authentication per run by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3187\n* [codex] add sidebar account menu and center model loading by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3191\n* [codex] fix browser settings dark theme background by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3192\n* feat: add Cursor CLI integration with isolated Studio MCP by @KK-Skyline in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3110\n* [codex] refresh session pins and fix workspace favorite controls by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3193\n* [codex] unify Agent picker order across chat and workflows by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3199\n* [codex] adapt Agent Manager layout and fix Cursor update status by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3201\n* [codex] fix Hermes upgrade compatibility and bridge worker lifecycle by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3202\n* [codex] add sequential browser action batches to Studio MCP by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3207\n* [codex] keep twelve browser tabs and evict the oldest on overflow by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3206\n* [codex] add configurable JEV assessments to browser automation by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3208\n* [codex] group JEV settings into responsive cards by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3209\n* fix: support large browser pages and remove action confirmation gates by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3212\n* [codex] return browser action evidence and compact stale snapshots by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3215\n* add optional JEV checks for group chat and workflows by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3211\n* chore: bump Studio and desktop to 0.7.25 with localized changelog by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3217\n* [codex] support DSH registry presets and native plugin configuration by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3218\n\n## New Contributors\n* @KK-Skyline made their first contribution in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3110\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/compare/v0.7.24...v0.7.25\n",
